{"id":6371,"date":"2026-08-19T10:30:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-19T09:30:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=6371"},"modified":"2026-07-03T11:42:00","modified_gmt":"2026-07-03T10:42:00","slug":"is-webador-the-right-choice-for-your-business","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/is-webador-the-right-choice-for-your-business\/","title":{"rendered":"Is Webador the right choice for your business?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Choosing a website builder can quickly become a headache. The goal isn&#8217;t to find the tool with the most buttons or technical options, but the one that fits your everyday life as an entrepreneur: fast, code-free, and affordable. At Webador, we believe in transparency. Here&#8217;s a guide to help you determine if our platform is right for you.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"943\" height=\"886\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Screenshot-2026-07-03-at-12.26.37.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6405\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.064343694317957;width:778px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Screenshot-2026-07-03-at-12.26.37.png 943w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Screenshot-2026-07-03-at-12.26.37-300x282.png 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Screenshot-2026-07-03-at-12.26.37-768x722.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 943px) 100vw, 943px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Is Webador for you?<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Webador is perfect for you if\u2026<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our platform was designed specifically to simplify the lives of specific profiles:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Local businesses and service providers:<\/strong>\u00a0Tradespeople, hairdressers, therapists, photographers, consultants. You need a professional website that displays your opening hours, services, portfolio, and a contact form in less than 2 hours.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Small shops and micro-creators:<\/strong>\u00a0Craftspeople, local producers, jewelry designers. You sell a manageable product range (less than 50 to 100 products) and you want to accept payments by card, Stripe, Mollie or PayPal in an ultra-secure way without setting up a complex system.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Passion and independent projects:<\/strong>\u00a0You launch a project alongside your job. You have neither the time to learn to code, nor the budget to pay a web agency thousands of euros.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Webador isn&#8217;t ideal if\u2026<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Because we prefer to guide you to the right tool rather than frustrate you, Webador is probably not suitable if:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>If you want to do large-scale e-commerce or dropshipping:<\/strong>\u00a0If you plan to import massive catalogs of thousands of products via CSV files, or if you want to fully automate dropshipping (with Printful, AliExpress, etc.), specialized and more robust platforms will be more appropriate.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>If you&#8217;re a web designer or a meticulous creative,<\/strong>\u00a0the Webador editor is intentionally structured to prevent layout errors. However, if you want to edit HTML\/CSS code down to the line or create ultra-complex visual animations, this rigidity will frustrate you.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>You need a complex membership or B2B space:<\/strong>\u00a0If your business model relies on recurring subscriptions, customer profiles with personalized dashboards or hidden rates depending on the type of customer connected.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What does Webador manages for you?\u00a0<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When comparing Webador to tools like WordPress, we often forget everything our &#8220;all-in-one&#8221; subscription takes care of to make your life easier:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Zero technical maintenance:<\/strong>\u00a0No theme or extension updates that crash the site on Sunday night.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Total security:<\/strong>\u00a0The SSL certificate, backups and protection against attacks are managed by our engineers.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Transparent pricing:<\/strong>\u00a0Hosting, domain name, professional email addresses, and the editor are included. No hidden costs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The verdict:<\/strong>&nbsp;If you are looking for a reliable, professional and easy-to-manage online presence on a daily basis, without the technical headaches, Webador is for you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30